## Why This Is Asked
This scenario tests comprehensive GCP data engineering skills including end-to-end data flow design, data validation, privacy compliance, and reliability patterns for beginners. It specifically evaluates understanding of idempotent writes via insertId and proper data retention practices.

## Key Concepts
- Cloud Functions (event-driven processing)
- Pub/Sub (asynchronous messaging)
- Cloud Run (containerized services)
- BigQuery (data warehousing)
- Cloud Storage (object storage)
- Data validation and schema enforcement
- PII redaction and privacy protection
- Idempotent operations and deduplication
- IAM principles and least privilege
- Retry strategies and error handling

## Code Example
```javascript
const crypto = require('crypto');

function redactPII(event, salt) {
  if (event.user_id) {
    event.user_id = crypto.createHash('sha256')
      .update(event.user_id + salt)
      .digest('hex');
  }
  if (event.device_id) {
    event.device_id = crypto.createHash('sha256')
      .update(event.device_id + salt)
      .digest('hex');
  }
  return event;
}
```

